# Gemini API Practice

Learning project exploring the Gemini API and LangChain — built while learning GenAI/LLM concepts for AI Engineer roles.

## What's covered
- Basic Gemini API calls (chat, streaming, multimodal)
- Function calling / tool use
- RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) — manual and LangChain versions
- LangChain: prompts, chains (LCEL), agents, memory
- Vector databases: FAISS, Chroma
- Document loaders (PDF, text, CSV, web)

